---
import {
  appendixBModel,
  pbeExchangeEnhancement,
  samplePbeEnhancement,
} from '../../../data/part07/lsdaGgaModel.mjs';

const xToSvg = (s) => 58 + (524 * s) / appendixBModel.reducedGradientRange[1];
const yToSvg = (value) => 246 - ((value - 0.95) * 190) / 0.95;
const samples = samplePbeEnhancement({ maxS: 6, count: 181 });
const path = samples
  .map((point, index) => `${index === 0 ? 'M' : 'L'} ${xToSvg(point.s).toFixed(2)} ${yToSvg(point.enhancement).toFixed(2)}`)
  .join(' ');
const fallbackValues = [0, 0.5, 1, 2, 4, 6].map((s) => ({
  s,
  enhancement: pbeExchangeEnhancement(s),
}));
---

<figure class="chapter-visual pbe-explorer" data-pbe-explorer>
  <figcaption>
    <strong>原创交互模型：PBE 交换增强因子</strong>
    <span lang="en">Original interactive model: the PBE exchange enhancement factor</span>
  </figcaption>

  <div class="chapter-visual__controls">
    <label>
      <span>约化梯度 s | Reduced gradient s</span>
      <input type="range" min="0" max="6" step="0.01" value="0" data-pbe-s />
      <output data-pbe-s-output>0.00</output>
    </label>
  </div>

  <svg viewBox="0 0 640 290" role="img" aria-labelledby="pbe-title pbe-desc">
    <title id="pbe-title">PBE exchange enhancement factor versus reduced density gradient</title>
    <desc id="pbe-desc">
      The PBE enhancement factor begins at one for zero reduced gradient and increases monotonically toward one plus kappa.
    </desc>
    <line x1="58" y1="246" x2="582" y2="246" class="plot-axis" />
    <line x1="58" y1="40" x2="58" y2="246" class="plot-axis" />
    <line x1="58" y1={yToSvg(1)} x2="582" y2={yToSvg(1)} class="plot-guide" />
    <line x1="58" y1={yToSvg(1 + appendixBModel.pbeKappa)} x2="582" y2={yToSvg(1 + appendixBModel.pbeKappa)} class="plot-guide" />
    <path d={path} class="plot-curve" />
    <circle cx={xToSvg(0)} cy={yToSvg(1)} r="6" class="pbe-explorer__marker" data-pbe-marker />
    <text x="58" y="270" text-anchor="middle">0</text>
    <text x="320" y="270" text-anchor="middle">3</text>
    <text x="582" y="270" text-anchor="middle">6</text>
    <text x="24" y="48">Fₓ(s)</text>
    <text x="62" y={yToSvg(1) - 6}>1</text>
    <text x="70" y={yToSvg(1 + appendixBModel.pbeKappa) - 6}>1 + κ</text>
  </svg>

  <div class="chapter-visual__readout" aria-live="polite">
    <span>增强因子 | Enhancement:</span>
    <strong data-pbe-enhancement>Fₓ(s) = 1.000000</strong>
    <span>相对上界距离 | Fraction of rise to 1+κ:</span>
    <strong data-pbe-fraction>0.00%</strong>
  </div>

  <div class="pbe-explorer__fallback">
    <p><strong>无 JavaScript 参考表 | No-JavaScript reference table</strong></p>
    <table>
      <thead><tr><th>s</th><th>Fₓ(s)</th></tr></thead>
      <tbody>
        {fallbackValues.map((row) => (
          <tr><td>{row.s.toFixed(2)}</td><td>{row.enhancement.toFixed(8)}</td></tr>
        ))}
      </tbody>
    </table>
  </div>

  <div class="chapter-visual__contract">
    <p><strong>模型：</strong><code>Fₓ(s)=1+κ−κ/(1+μs²/κ)</code>，使用 Martin Appendix B 的 <code>κ=0.804</code>、<code>μ=0.21951</code>。</p>
    <p lang="en"><strong>Model:</strong> <code>Fₓ(s)=1+κ−κ/(1+μs²/κ)</code>, with <code>κ=0.804</code> and <code>μ=0.21951</code> as listed in Martin Appendix B.</p>
    <p><strong>解析验收：</strong><code>Fₓ(0)=1</code>，对 <code>s&gt;0</code> 单调增加，并在 <code>s→∞</code> 时趋向 <code>1+κ=1.804</code>。</p>
    <p lang="en"><strong>Analytic acceptance:</strong> <code>Fₓ(0)=1</code>, the function increases for <code>s&gt;0</code>, and approaches <code>1+κ=1.804</code> as <code>s→∞</code>.</p>
    <p><strong>边界：</strong>交换增强因子只定义 PBE 交换的一部分；它不检验相关项、泛函导数、赝势一致性或材料特定误差。</p>
    <p lang="en"><strong>Boundary:</strong> the exchange enhancement factor is only one part of PBE exchange. It does not test correlation, functional derivatives, pseudopotential consistency, or material-specific error.</p>
  </div>
</figure>

<script>
  import {
    appendixBModel,
    pbeExchangeEnhancement,
  } from '../../../data/part07/lsdaGgaModel.mjs';

  document.querySelectorAll('[data-pbe-explorer]').forEach((root) => {
    const input = root.querySelector('[data-pbe-s]');
    const sOutput = root.querySelector('[data-pbe-s-output]');
    const enhancementOutput = root.querySelector('[data-pbe-enhancement]');
    const fractionOutput = root.querySelector('[data-pbe-fraction]');
    const marker = root.querySelector('[data-pbe-marker]');
    if (!(input instanceof HTMLInputElement) || !(marker instanceof SVGCircleElement)) return;

    const xToSvg = (s) => 58 + (524 * s) / 6;
    const yToSvg = (value) => 246 - ((value - 0.95) * 190) / 0.95;

    const update = () => {
      const s = Number(input.value);
      if (!Number.isFinite(s)) return;
      const enhancement = pbeExchangeEnhancement(s);
      const fraction = (enhancement - 1) / appendixBModel.pbeKappa;
      marker.setAttribute('cx', xToSvg(s).toFixed(2));
      marker.setAttribute('cy', yToSvg(enhancement).toFixed(2));
      if (sOutput instanceof HTMLOutputElement) sOutput.value = s.toFixed(2);
      if (enhancementOutput instanceof HTMLElement) {
        enhancementOutput.textContent = `Fₓ(s) = ${enhancement.toFixed(6)}`;
      }
      if (fractionOutput instanceof HTMLElement) {
        fractionOutput.textContent = `${(100 * fraction).toFixed(2)}%`;
      }
    };

    input.addEventListener('input', update);
    update();
  });
</script>

<style>
  .pbe-explorer {
    overflow-x: auto;
  }

  .pbe-explorer svg {
    width: 100%;
    min-width: 34rem;
  }

  .pbe-explorer text {
    fill: currentColor;
    font-size: 13px;
  }

  .pbe-explorer__marker {
    fill: var(--sl-color-accent-high);
    stroke: currentColor;
    stroke-width: 1;
  }

  .pbe-explorer__fallback {
    max-width: 25rem;
    margin-top: 0.8rem;
  }

  .pbe-explorer__fallback table {
    width: 100%;
  }
</style>
